// Today is a pie-eating contest at the local school! The school has been given some pies by families, and we need to figure out how many pies we can split amongst 4 contestants. We can only give whole pies to the contestants. Ask the user how many pies the families brought, then printToScreen() how many pies each contestant will have to eat, and how many pies will be left over.

// Solution

const numContestants = 4;

let pies = +prompt("How many pies was the school given?");

let piesPer = Math.floor(pies/numContestants);

let leftovers = pies % numContestants;

printToScreen("There were " + pies + " pie(s) received, so each contestant received " + piesPer + " pies each and we had " + leftovers + " leftover pies.");

